    <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="sql触发器">SQL触发器</h1>
<p>触发器(Trigger)是数据库中的一种特殊存储过程，它会在特定事件(如INSERT、UPDATE、DELETE)发生时自动执行。触发器主要用于维护数据的完整性、实施业务规则以及审计数据变更。</p>
<h2 id="一触发器的基本概念">一、触发器的基本概念</h2>
<h3 id="1-触发器的定义">1. 触发器的定义</h3>
<p>触发器是一段与表相关联的PL/SQL代码，当表发生特定事件时自动执行。触发器不接收参数，也不能被直接调用。</p>
<h3 id="2-触发器的组成要素">2. 触发器的组成要素</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>触发事件</strong>：引起触发器执行的操作(INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE)</li>
<li><strong>触发时间</strong>：BEFORE或AFTER，表示在事件之前或之后触发</li>
<li><strong>触发级别</strong>：ROW或STATEMENT，表示行级或语句级触发</li>
<li><strong>触发条件</strong>：WHEN子句指定的额外条件</li>
<li><strong>触发体</strong>：触发器被激活时执行的PL/SQL代码块</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="3-触发器的分类">3. 触发器的分类</h3>
<h4 id="按触发时间分类">按触发时间分类</h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>BEFORE触发器</strong>：在触发事件执行之前激活</li>
<li><strong>AFTER触发器</strong>：在触发事件执行之后激活</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="按触发级别分类">按触发级别分类</h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>行级触发器(ROW)</strong>：对受影响的每一行都触发一次</li>
<li><strong>语句级触发器(STATEMENT)</strong>：对整个SQL语句触发一次</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="按触发事件分类">按触发事件分类</h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>INSERT触发器</strong>：当插入数据时触发</li>
<li><strong>UPDATE触发器</strong>：当更新数据时触发</li>
<li><strong>DELETE触发器</strong>：当删除数据时触发</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="二触发器的创建语法">二、触发器的创建语法</h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">CREATE</span> [<span style="color:#66d9ef">OR</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">REPLACE</span>] <span style="color:#66d9ef">TRIGGER</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">trigger_name</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010">{</span><span style="color:#66d9ef">BEFORE</span> <span style="color:#f92672">|</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">AFTER</span><span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010">}</span> <span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010">{</span><span style="color:#66d9ef">INSERT</span> <span style="color:#f92672">|</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">UPDATE</span> <span style="color:#f92672">|</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">DELETE</span> [<span style="color:#66d9ef">OF</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">column_name</span>,...]<span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010">}</span> 
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">ON</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">table_name</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>[<span style="color:#66d9ef">REFERENCING</span> [<span style="color:#66d9ef">OLD</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">AS</span> old_name] [<span style="color:#66d9ef">NEW</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">AS</span> new_name]]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>[<span style="color:#66d9ef">FOR</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">EACH</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">ROW</span>]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>[<span style="color:#66d9ef">WHEN</span> (condition)]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">DECLARE</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#75715e">-- 声明部分(可选)
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"></span><span style="color:#66d9ef">BEGIN</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#75715e">-- 执行部分
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"></span><span style="color:#66d9ef">EXCEPTION</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#75715e">-- 异常处理部分(可选)
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"></span><span style="color:#66d9ef">END</span>;
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="三触发器的详细使用">三、触发器的详细使用</h2>
<h3 id="1-before触发器">1. BEFORE触发器</h3>
<p>在数据被修改前执行，常用于数据验证或修改即将插入/更新的数据。</p>
<p><strong>示例1：数据验证</strong></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">CREATE</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">OR</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">REPLACE</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">TRIGGER</span> check_salary
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">BEFORE</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">INSERT</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">OR</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">UPDATE</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">ON</span> employees
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">FOR</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">EACH</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">ROW</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">BEGIN</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#66d9ef">IF</span> :<span style="color:#66d9ef">NEW</span>.salary <span style="color:#f92672">&lt;</span> <span style="color:#ae81ff">0</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">THEN</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        RAISE_APPLICATION_ERROR(<span style="color:#f92672">-</span><span style="color:#ae81ff">20001</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;Salary cannot be negative&#39;</span>);
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#66d9ef">END</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">IF</span>;
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">END</span>;
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例2：自动计算字段值</strong></p>]]></description>
